                                "sense_id": "c402bc43-c66d-3b25-a2d4-8141dbe82f82",
                                "text": "De gevolgen van deze nieuwe wending zijn ongewis.",
                                "translation": "The consequences of this new turn of events are uncertain.",
                                "english": "The consequences of this new turn of events are uncertain."
                            },
                            {
